    {
      "id": "687cec0e-3b8c-441f-a22d-3bae36798be8",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "b531b11e-eebc-4680-a116-21679cbb542d",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Dot: The bell wire\ngoes to this\nantenna. Its brass\ntag says SEND",
                "NORTH. The vane\npoints toward\nAurora when its\narrow meets the\nnotch.",
                "Wind moved the\nvane, but the\nnotch is still cut\ninto the stone."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "97dd6a43-a020-4628-a1fe-dcf30f020e3b",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "ad50075b-4f58-4def-aee5-bdad40fd8518",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Three entries\nsurvive in the\nwatch log. At\nseven, the roof\nsent its",
                "alarm. At eight,\nAurora recorded\nthat alarm. At\nnine, Aurora",
                "attempted a reply,\nbut no roof\nreceipt was\nlogged. Dot points\nout",
                "that the first two\nentries show a\nsuccessful outward\npath. A later",
                "problem may affect\nthe return path\nwithout erasing\nthe earlier",
                "delivery. The\nwatch keeper wants\nhis crew cleared\nof a false",
                "accusation."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f416332-200f-461b-afb6-40a741deb4a6",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "257e3921-7251-4531-a047-9fa72e056ef2",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "A waxed parcel\nholds the watch\nlog, kept dry\nbeneath the chest\nlid.",
                "The alarm was\nsent. The\nacknowledgment\nnever came back.\nDot reads",
                "this twice, then\nasks you to carry\nthe original while\nshe keeps an",
                "exact copy."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8b58ea95-d605-40d6-a712-a0fc9bdc8e0b",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "999550c5-9b09-4e14-a189-7d2f77077393",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Align the vane for\nthe signal\ndestination named\non the antenna\ntag.",
                "Which direction\nmatches its fixed\nstone mark?"
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "82d05257-3969-4c3f-a6d5-1bee36d17d48",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "62856fe6-fb10-453c-ada8-e57008367043",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which leg needs\ninvestigation\nfirst: the alarm\nleaving the roof,\nthe",
                "alarm reaching\nAurora, or the\nattempted reply\nreturning? Use the",
                "separate entries\nrather than\nassuming the whole\nsystem either\nworked",
                "or failed. The\nwatch keeper has\nwaited years to\nhear an answer\nthat",
                "distinguishes what\nhis crew did from\nwhat the machinery\ncould",
                "confirm."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a3f004ca-5f86-4e93-a8bd-fc7f16d94521",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "4f7f25c4-2d2e-4060-a80a-6b364d563adb",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Clerk: We received\nthe bell. We sent\na reply through\nthe same wire",
                "after the relay\nfroze. That reply\nnever left the\nbuilding. Two",
                "messages, one\nwire, and no other\nway to ask for\nhelp. Dot shuts\nher",
                "notebook very\nsoftly."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
  ]
